{
  "provider": "datadog",
  "protocol": "http",
  "display": {
    "name": "Datadog",
    "category": "Observability",
    "blurb": "Query and manage Datadog through `pup` plus the engrams-owned `datadog` REST and Continuous Profiler CLI. Both keys are brokered at the egress proxy, never seen by the agent.",
    "icon": { "mono": "DD", "color": "#632ca6" }
  },
  "credential": {
    "source": "inject",
    "injects": [
      {
        "header": "DD-API-KEY",
        "secretRef": "datadog-api-key",
        "hosts": ["api.datadoghq.com"]
      },
      {
        "header": "DD-APPLICATION-KEY",
        "secretRef": "datadog-app-key",
        "hosts": ["api.datadoghq.com"]
      },
      {
        "header": "DD_API_KEY",
        "secretRef": "datadog-api-key",
        "hosts": ["mcp.datadoghq.com"]
      },
      {
        "header": "DD_APPLICATION_KEY",
        "secretRef": "datadog-app-key",
        "hosts": ["mcp.datadoghq.com"]
      }
    ]
  },
  "hosts": ["api.datadoghq.com", "mcp.datadoghq.com"],
  "test": { "path": "/api/v1/dashboard" },
  "operations": [
    {
      "grants": ["logs:read"],
      "match": { "method": "GET", "path": "/api/v2/logs/events*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["logs:read"],
      "match": { "method": "POST", "path": "/api/v2/logs/events/search" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["metrics:read"],
      "match": { "method": "GET", "path": "/api/v1/query*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["metrics:read"],
      "match": { "method": "GET", "path": "/api/v1/metrics*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["metrics:read"],
      "match": { "method": "GET", "path": "/api/v2/metrics*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["metrics:read"],
      "match": { "method": "POST", "path": "/api/v2/query/timeseries" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["metrics:read"],
      "match": { "method": "POST", "path": "/api/v2/query/scalar" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["monitors:read"],
      "match": { "method": "GET", "path": "/api/v1/monitor*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["monitors:write"],
      "match": { "method": "POST", "path": "/api/v1/monitor*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["monitors:write"],
      "match": { "method": "PUT", "path": "/api/v1/monitor/*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["monitors:write"],
      "match": { "method": "DELETE", "path": "/api/v1/monitor/*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["dashboards:read"],
      "match": { "method": "GET", "path": "/api/v1/dashboard*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["dashboards:write"],
      "match": { "method": "POST", "path": "/api/v1/dashboard*" },
      "asset": {
        "kind": "dashboard",
        "surface": "asset",
        "success": { "statusClass": "2xx" },
        "data": { "id": "$.resp.id", "title": "$.resp.title" },
        "fetchable": { "external": "$.resp.url" }
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["dashboards:write"],
      "match": { "method": "PUT", "path": "/api/v1/dashboard/*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["dashboards:write"],
      "match": { "method": "DELETE", "path": "/api/v1/dashboard/*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["events:read"],
      "match": { "method": "GET", "path": "/api/v1/events*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["events:read"],
      "match": { "method": "GET", "path": "/api/v2/events*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["events:read"],
      "match": { "method": "POST", "path": "/api/v2/events/search" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["events:write"],
      "match": { "method": "POST", "path": "/api/v1/events" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["incidents:read"],
      "match": { "method": "GET", "path": "/api/v2/incidents*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["incidents:write"],
      "match": { "method": "POST", "path": "/api/v2/incidents*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["incidents:write"],
      "match": { "method": "PATCH", "path": "/api/v2/incidents/*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["slos:read"],
      "match": { "method": "GET", "path": "/api/v1/slo*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["hosts:read"],
      "match": { "method": "GET", "path": "/api/v1/hosts*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["synthetics:read"],
      "match": { "method": "GET", "path": "/api/v1/synthetics/*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["downtimes:read"],
      "match": { "method": "GET", "path": "/api/v1/downtime*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["downtimes:read"],
      "match": { "method": "GET", "path": "/api/v2/downtime*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["apm:read"],
      "match": { "method": "GET", "path": "/api/v2/spans*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["apm:read"],
      "match": { "method": "POST", "path": "/api/v2/spans/events/search" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["apm:read"],
      "match": { "method": "POST", "path": "/api/v2/spans/analytics/aggregate" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["profiling:read"],
      "match": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/api/unstable/mcp-server/mcp?toolsets=profiling"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["notebooks:read"],
      "match": { "method": "GET", "path": "/api/v1/notebooks*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["users:read"],
      "match": { "method": "GET", "path": "/api/v2/users*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["tags:read"],
      "match": { "method": "GET", "path": "/api/v1/tags/*" }
    },

    {
      "grants": ["ci_pipelines:read"],
      "match": { "method": "GET", "path": "/api/v2/ci/pipelines/events*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["ci_pipelines:read"],
      "match": { "method": "POST", "path": "/api/v2/ci/pipelines/events/search" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["ci_pipelines:read"],
      "match": { "method": "POST", "path": "/api/v2/ci/pipelines/analytics/aggregate" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["ci_pipelines:write"],
      "match": { "method": "POST", "path": "/api/v2/ci/pipeline" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["ci_tests:read"],
      "match": { "method": "GET", "path": "/api/v2/ci/tests/events*" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["ci_tests:read"],
      "match": { "method": "POST", "path": "/api/v2/ci/tests/events/search" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["ci_tests:read"],
      "match": { "method": "POST", "path": "/api/v2/ci/tests/analytics/aggregate" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["test_optimization:read"],
      "match": { "method": "POST", "path": "/api/v2/test/flaky-test-management/tests" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["test_optimization:read"],
      "match": { "method": "POST", "path": "/api/v2/ci/test-optimization/settings/service" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["test_optimization:read"],
      "match": { "method": "POST", "path": "/api/v2/ci/test-optimization/settings/policies" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["test_optimization:write"],
      "match": { "method": "PATCH", "path": "/api/v2/test/flaky-test-management/tests" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["test_optimization:write"],
      "match": { "method": "PATCH", "path": "/api/v2/ci/test-optimization/settings/service" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["test_optimization:write"],
      "match": { "method": "DELETE", "path": "/api/v2/ci/test-optimization/settings/service" }
    },
    {
      "grants": ["test_optimization:write"],
      "match": { "method": "PATCH", "path": "/api/v2/ci/test-optimization/settings/policies" }
    }
  ],
  "cli": {
    "bins": ["pup", "datadog"],
    "dummyEnv": { "DD_API_KEY": "x-engrams-managed", "DD_APP_KEY": "x-engrams-managed" },
    "doc": "Choose the Datadog command by the question:\n- Use `datadog profiling` for allocations, CPU profiles, flame graphs, call graphs, and profile time series.\n- Use `pup` for its broad, structured Datadog API command surface.\n- Use `datadog api <METHOD> <PATH> [JSON]` when `pup` does not expose an allowed REST endpoint or request shape.\n\nAuthentication is automatic: `DD_API_KEY` and `DD_APP_KEY` are managed placeholders that the egress proxy replaces with the real keys only on permitted requests. Do NOT run `pup auth login` or set real keys.\n\nContinuous Profiler (requires `profiling:read`, plus Datadog application-key permissions `mcp_read` and `continuous_profiler_read`):\n1. `datadog profiling tools` — list the profiling-only MCP tools and their current input schemas.\n2. `datadog profiling schema explore_profiling_flame_graph` — inspect one exact schema.\n3. `datadog profiling call get_profiling_profile_types '{...}'` — discover the profile families and sample types for a service, trace, or time range.\n4. Call `explore_profiling_flame_graph` or `get_profiling_timeseries` with the discovered allocation sample type to find high-allocation endpoints, methods, and stacks. The fixed upstream endpoint exposes only Datadog's `profiling` toolset. JVM allocation-rate metrics are service-level signals; do not present them as trace, endpoint, or stack attribution. If `profiling:read` is unavailable, report that boundary instead.\n\nRaw REST example: span aggregation is `datadog api POST /api/v2/spans/analytics/aggregate '<body>'` and requires `apm:read`. `pup traces aggregate` uses the same now-authorized path.\n\nOther powers:\n- Observability read: `logs:read`, `metrics:read`, `monitors:read`, `dashboards:read`, `events:read`, `incidents:read`, `slos:read`, `hosts:read`, `synthetics:read`, `downtimes:read`, `apm:read` (span search and aggregation), `notebooks:read`, `users:read`, `tags:read`.\n- Observability write: `monitors:write`, `dashboards:write`, `events:write`, `incidents:write`.\n- CI Visibility & Test Optimization: `ci_pipelines:read`, `ci_tests:read`, `test_optimization:read`, `ci_pipelines:write`, `test_optimization:write`.\n\nThis connector targets Datadog US1. A path or profiling endpoint that the profile did not grant is denied at the network boundary. Run `pup --help` or `datadog --help` to explore."
  }
}
